Subject: Seth's Blog: Who is the leader?
Date: Thu, 21 May 2026 08:00:00 +0000
Message-ID: <seth2@sethgodin.com>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/html; charset="utf-8"

<p>Leadership isn't management. Management is about doing things right; leadership is about doing the right things.</p>
<p>If you build a culture of fear, you shouldn't be surprised when people hide their best work.</p>
